WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:01.912
Section 1.

00:00:01.862 --> 00:00:04.587
The Protection That Doesn't Exist.

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:09.850
The Public Servants Disclosure Protection Act was supposed to shield whistleblowers.

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:16.275
Over seventeen years, the numbers tell the story of a law that exists on paper and nowhere else.
